  "_notes": [
    "Categories are defined ONCE here and referenced by id from each",
    "business-type template in templates/*.json — this resolves the",
    "shared-category question from the discussion: categories that",
    "naturally recur across types (soft drinks, tobacco, bottled water)",
    "are defined once rather than duplicated, so corrections don't drift",
    "out of sync across templates.",
    "'shared' = true means 2+ business types reference it.",
    "This is a draft structure — category boundaries and naming are",
    "exactly the kind of thing that needs real review, not brand names",
    "alone."
